	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Ｎ『[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]……ここは
ボクの　せかい　だった　ばしょ[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:53:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:13:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｎ『[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]……ここは
ボクの　世界だった　場所[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:54:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・連れ歩きでこの部屋に入ったとき
　初回のみイベント発生
・続けてboss_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:44:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOSS
Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T09:22:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T13:03:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ボクは　おさないころに　ふかい
もりの　おくに　おきざりに　された▼
そんな　ボクを　そだててくれたのは
もりの　ポケモンたち　だった……[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:53:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:33:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ボクは　幼いころに
深い　森の奥に　置き去りに　された▼
そんな　ボクを　育ててくれたのは
森の　ポケモンたち　だった……[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:54:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・部屋の中央に移動し
　上向きでメッセージ表示
・続けてboss_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:45:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOSS
Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T09:22:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T13:03:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]あるひのこと　ボクの　まえに
おやと　なのる　おとこが　あらわれた▼
それが　ゲーチス[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:53:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:33:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ある日のこと　ボクの　前に
親と　名乗る　男が　現れた▼
それが　ゲーチス[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:54:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・主人公と向き合ってメッセージ表示
・続けてboss_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:45:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOSS
Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T09:22:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T13:03:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]カレが　ボクに　あたえてくれたのは
ハルモニア　という　なまえ▼
おうとしての　かずおおくの　ちしき▼
かたく　かたく　こころを　とざし
はなすことも　できない　ポケモン▼
そして　この　へや……[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:53:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:33:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]カレが　ボクに　与えてくれたのは
ハルモニア　という　名前▼
王としての　数多くの　知識▼
かたく　かたく　心を　閉ざし
話すことも　できない　ポケモン▼
そして　この部屋……[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T05:05:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T08:34:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・左右を見てから
　主人公と向き合いメッセージ表示
・続けてboss_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:45:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOSS
Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-03T09:22:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T13:03:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#408080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
